    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258-a3">

                <pb facs="0426" n="332" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg332"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 to No. 751—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lincoln to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <p>United States sheep will be admitted without slaughter on and after the 1st next
                    September at fifteen ports of Great Britain under conditions guarding against
                    infectious and requiring bond on each cargo. I think conditions could be
                    communicated by telegraph substantially within 200 ciphers. Shall I do so?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lincoln.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
